<title>HONG KONG: Winfair Inv interim profit down 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Winfair Inv interim profit down 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   23.2  vs  36.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    9.28  vs  14.49</p>
<p>    Turnover		     14.95 vs  21.35</p>
<p>    Company name		 Winfair Investment Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 13-17</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 28</p>
<p>NOTE - Winfair Investment is a property investment group. It proposes a special cash dividend of 10 H.K. cents vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
